---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Anim from "../../components/Anim.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="@open-rgs/pay-anywhere  - Scatters"
  description="Pay-anywhere: Total count, position irrelevant."
>
  <main>
    <p class="dim"><a href="/extension">&larr; extensions</a></p>
    <h1>@open-rgs/pay-anywhere</h1>

    <p class="lede">Total count, position irrelevant.</p>

    <Anim kind="pay-anywhere" caption="Triggering is kept separate from paying: plenty of games trigger on 3 scatters while paying nothing for them." />

    <p>The smallest evaluator with the largest effect on a game's shape, because it is almost always what triggers the feature - and feature frequency is usually the single biggest term in RTP. Only literal matches count, never a wild.</p>

    <h2 data-section="&sect;">Reach for</h2>
    <pre><code>{`import { ... } from "@open-rgs/pay-anywhere";`}</code></pre>
    <p class="dim">evalAnywhere  &middot;  evalScatters  &middot;  triggersOn  &middot;  shortOfTrigger</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
